d 'GEMINI': module to use Google's Gemini AI from the Stata command line via the Gemini CLI
d
d  gemini wraps the official Google Gemini CLI so that a prompt can
d be sent, and its answer read back, without leaving Stata. Use it
d to run live web searches for data and facts, generate synthetic
d datasets for testing, get help with Stata syntax and coding
d logic, and pull structured output (csv or json) straight into
d memory with the clear option. (npm install -g @google/gemini-cli)
d authenticated against a Google account. 
d
d KW: large language model; API; text analysis; utilities
d
d Requires: Stata version 16.0
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f gemini.ado
f gemini.sthlp
